  "answer_text": "Domino\u2019s offers excellent ways to save through nationwide promotions, local coupon codes, and limited-time events. \n\n### \ud83d\udea8 Limited-Time & National Deals (No Code Required)\nYou can usually apply these directly from the **Deals** or **Coupons** page on the Domino's app or website:\n\n* **50% Off All Menu-Priced Pizzas (Ends Today, June 7, 2026):** Domino\u2019s is running its major 50% off deal on all menu-priced pizzas ordered online, in-app, or in-store. \n* **Mix & Match Deal ($6.99 each):** Choose any two or more medium 2-topping pizzas, breads, pastas, salads, sandwiches, or desserts for $6.99 each.\n* **Weeklong Carryout Deal ($7.99 each):** Get a 3-topping pizza (excluding XL and specialty crusts like stuffed crust) or 8-piece wings/boneless chicken for just $7.99. *Carryout only.*\n* **The Perfect Combo ($19.99):** Includes 2 medium 1-topping pizzas, a 16-piece order of Parmesan Bread Bites, an 8-piece order of Cinnamon Bread Twists, and a 2-liter bottle of soda.\n* **Parmesan Stuffed Crust Deal ($10.99 each + Free Slice Sauce):** Mix and match two or more 2-topping Parmesan Stuffed Crust Pizzas for $10.99 each and get a free container of Domino's Slice Sauce (Runs through June 14, 2026).\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f Popular Domino's Promo Codes (Enter at Checkout)\nThese are widely tracked promo codes that work at many U.S. franchise locations. Keep in mind that some franchises disable certain codes, so you may need to try more than one:\n\n* **`50off`** \u2013 50% off select menu-priced pizzas.\n* **`35OFF`** \u2013 35% off your entire order (applies to regular menu-priced items).\n* **`9174`** \u2013 40% off a large pizza with 3 toppings. *(Note: Highly popular, but disabled at some franchise locations).*\n* **`5162`** \u2013 40% off a medium pizza with 5 toppings.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Tips for Maximum Savings\n\n1. **Check Your Local Coupons Tab:** Domino\u2019s pricing is heavily franchise-dependent. On the app or Dominos.com, input your delivery address or carryout ZIP code first, then click on the **Coupons** tab. This will reveal exclusive deals tailored strictly to your closest store.\n2. **Join Domino\u2019s Rewards:** If you order even occasionally, make sure you sign up for their free loyalty program. You earn points on every order, which you can quickly redeem for free pizzas, cheesy bread, desserts, or drinks.\n3. **Emergency Pizza Promo (Through June 10, 2026):** If you are a Domino's Rewards member, you can register on their website to win a free medium 2-topping \"Emergency Pizza\" if a red card is issued during the international soccer tournament.",
